#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "and get an estimate of the ground state energy $c_{min}$\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"For a single-particle sector, we can efficiently calculate the ground state "
"of this sector of the Hamiltonian classically\n"
