#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/krylov-quantum-"
"diagonalization/extracted-"
"outputs/4bc52594-0376-497f-8a61-0949415a1fe0-0.avif)\n"
